# CODEOWNERS — declares which engineer(s) own each path in `/root`.
# GitHub uses this file to suggest reviewers and enforce required code-owner
# reviews on protected branches.
#
# Last verified: 2026-07 against GitHub's CODEOWNERS syntax v3
# Encodes ADR-0001: solo operator with disciplined review.
#
# Note: `/root` is a curriculum + Astro static site — not a K8s platform repo.
# Ownership rules reflect that scope. basecamp's CODEOWNERS handles platform
# paths; each module repo (`ascent`, `crag`, etc.) has its own.
#
# Syntax:
#   <path-glob>  <owner>  [additional-owners]
#
# Rules:
# - Order matters: later rules override earlier rules for the same path.
# - GitHub handles must be @-prefixed. Teams: @<org>/<team>.
# - Inline comments via #.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default owner — applies to anything not matched by a more specific rule.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                               @abukix

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The curriculum content — the primary artifact of `/root`.
# When co-maintainers join (post-v1.0), curriculum reviewers might be added here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/src/content/docs/              @abukix

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The site code — Astro components, layouts, pages, styles.
# Site fixes are welcome; require voice + accessibility review.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/src/components/                @abukix
/src/layouts/                   @abukix
/src/pages/                     @abukix
/src/styles/                    @abukix
/astro.config.mjs               @abukix

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADRs — architectural decisions. Never edit an accepted ADR; supersede.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/adrs/                          @abukix

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
